{"seq":2,"at":"2026-10-20","kind":"edited","target":{"type":"article","id":"a1147"},"reason":"Rewritten by the merge to take in the printed cards' questions.","by":"merge society/business","ref":"quiz-archive/runs/tp-ingest/decisions/society__business.json","changes":[{"field":"bodyEn","diff":[["=",738],["+","Sportswear has had its fateful marriages too. In August 2005 Adidas announced that it would buy the American brand Reebok for about 3.8 billion dollars, and the deal closed in early 2006; the Herzogenaurach company hoped to challenge Nike on its home market. The partnership never prospered, and in 2021 Adidas agreed to sell Reebok to Authentic Brands Group.\n\n"],["=",88],["+","Reebok | Adidas | 2006 |\n| "],["=",11]]},{"field":"bodyDe","diff":[["=",702],["+","Auch die Sportartikelbranche kennt folgenreiche Ehen. Im August 2005 kündigte Adidas an, die amerikanische Marke Reebok für rund 3,8 Milliarden Dollar zu kaufen, Anfang 2006 war der Deal vollzogen; das Unternehmen aus Herzogenaurach wollte Nike auf dessen Heimatmarkt herausfordern. Die Verbindung wurde nie glücklich, und 2021 vereinbarte Adidas den Verkauf von Reebok an die Authentic Brands Group.\n\n"],["=",90],["+","Reebok | Adidas | 2006 |\n| "],["=",11]]}]},
